SUMMARY:Deadline 23:59 EST: Knight-Wallace Journalism Fellowships 2027-28 (
 University of Michigan)
DESCRIPTION:Closes 01 Dec 2026 at 23:59 EST.\n\nAn academic-year fellowship
  for mid-career journalists to pursue a study project at the University of
  Michigan\, with seminars and programming at Wallace House. DEADLINES: int
 ernational applicants 1 December 2026\, 11:59 pm ET\; US applicants 1 Febr
 uary 2027. No application fee stated.\n\nOrganisation: Wallace House Cente
 r for Journalists\, University of Michigan\nLocation: Ann Arbor\, Michigan
 \, USA (in residence for the academic year). Open to journalists of any na
 tionality.\nAward: USD 85\,000 stipend plus USD 5\,000 relocation (figures
  from secondary listings\; confirm on the official site).\nDuration: Acade
 mic year 2027-28.\n\nMore: https://wallacehouse.umich.edu/knight-wallace/?
 utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://wallacehouse.umich.edu/knight-wallace/?utm_source=artificialnou
 veaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:Ann Arbor\, Michigan\, USA (in residence for the academic year). O
 pen to journalists of any nationality.
END:VEVENT
